  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Assistance for Emergency Response (SAFER IV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the ongoing SAFER programme is to alleviate the aftermath ofhumanitarian crises through the dignifying provision of multipurpose cash assistance (MPCA) and water, sanitation, and hygiene services (WASH) to vulnerable households affected by shocks, whether man-made or caused by natural disasters. Among the survivors of humanitarian crises, the SAFER consortium will continue to reach the most vulnerable internally displaced people (IDPs), returnees, and host communities. The programme will contribute to assist them to meet their critical basic needs and prevent reliance on negative coping mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
